-radius); box-shadow:var(--shadow);\n    width:fit-content; margin:14px auto 0;\n    font-size:12px; line-height:1.3;\n    display:flex; align-items:center; gap:5px;\n  }\n  .sp-avatars{ display:flex; align-items:center; }\n  .sp-avatar{\n    width:20px; height:22px; border-radius:9999px; overflow:hidden; flex:0 0 auto;\n    border:2px solid #fff; margin-right:-6px;\n  }\n  .sp-avatar img{ width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; display:block; }\n  .sp-text{ display:flex; align-items:center; gap:5px; flex-wrap:nowrap; }\n  .sp-name{ font-weight:700; }\n  .sp-strong{ font-weight:700; }\n  .sp-check{ width:16px; height:16px; display:inline-block; }\n<\/style>\n\n{%- assign buyer_name = \"Lisa A\" -%}\n{%- assign buyer_count = 10.059 -%}\n\n<div class=\"sp-bar\">\n  <div class=\"sp-avatars\">\n    <span class=\"sp-avatar\">\n      <img src=\"https:\/\/randomuser.me\/api\/portraits\/women\/44.jpg\" alt=\"Kunde 1\">\n    <\/span>\n    <span class=\"sp-avatar\">\n      <img src=\"https:\/\/randomuser.me\/api\/portraits\/women\/65.jpg\" alt=\"Kunde 2\">\n    <\/span>\n    <span class=\"sp-avatar\">\n      <img src=\"https:\/\/randomuser.me\/api\/portraits\/women\/12.jpg\" alt=\"Kunde 3\">\n    <\/span>\n  <\/div>\n\n  <div class=\"sp-text\">\n    <span class=\"sp-name\">{{ buyer_name }}<\/span>\n    <span class=\"sp-check\">\n      <img src=\"https:\/\/cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com\/512\/7641\/7641727.png\" alt=\"Verifisert\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">\n    <\/span>\n    <span>and<\/span>\n    <span class=\"sp-strong\">{{ buyer_count }}<\/span>\n    <span>other dog parents has purchased<\/span>\n  <\/div>\n<\/div>"}},"149aabfb-9fd8-4472-a633-6032dbe01ed0":{"type":"reviews","disabled":true,"settings":{"color_scheme":"background-1","show_custom_bg":false,"custom_bg_color":"#f2f2f2","corner_radius":12,"border_width":0,"border_color":"#b7b7b7","avatar_alignment":"top","avatar_corner_radius":40,"star_color":"#ffcc00","stars_translate":0,"checkmark_color":"#6d388b","checkmark_icon_color":"#ffffff","slider_type":"slide","autoplay":false,"autoplay_speed":5,"display_arrows":false,"display_dots":true,"author_1":"Annika, matte till Elsa 6 år","image_1":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Profilbild3.webp","text_1":"<p>Vår golden retriever har alltid haft det tufft när det är varmt, speciellt på nätterna. Hon flämtade konstant och bytte plats hela tiden. Vi köpte kylmattan lite på chans – men det visade sig vara den bästa investeringen på länge. Hon lägger sig på den själv och sover lugnt hela natten nu.<\/p>","author_2":"Jonas & Maria, hundföräldrar till Bosse 4 år","text_2":"<p>Vår mops har alltid haft svårt med värmen, och bilresor sommartid har varit en kamp. Nu lägger vi kylmattan i buren varje gång vi ska iväg och det gör all skillnad. Han blir lugn, flämtar inte längre och hela resan blir mycket mindre stressig – för både honom och oss.<\/p>","author_3":"Sandra, matte till Leo 7 år","image_3":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Profilbild_3.webp","text_3":"<p>Jag märkte förra sommaren hur min labbe blev låg när det var varmt. Han åt mindre, var trött och verkade allmänt obekväm. Med kylmattan ser jag att han söker sig dit direkt när han blir varm, och han kan vila utan att bli påverkad. Den bara funkar, helt enkelt.<\/p>","margin_top":24,"margin_bottom":24}},"collapsible_tab_m47gWN":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Free E-Book: House Trained in 4 Weeks","heading_size":"medium","icon":"","filled_icon":false,"collapse_icon":"carret","display_top_border":true,"open":false,"content":"","page":"free-e-book-house-trained-in-4-weeks","margin_top":24,"margin_bottom":0}},"collapsible_tab_gk4a3W":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Description","heading_size":"medium","icon":"","filled_icon":false,"collapse_icon":"carret","display_top_border":true,"open":false,"content":"<p><strong>The DryPad<\/strong> is the perfect solution for dog owners who want a clean, simple, and odor-free home.<br\/><br\/>It is developed <strong>by experts and veterinarians<\/strong> to help your dog understand where to pee – completely without stress or training.<\/p><p>With its patented scent technology, the pad naturally attracts the dog, making it instinctively choose it as its toilet spot.<br\/><br\/>The <strong>4-layer super-absorbent core <\/strong>keeps floors dry, while the antimicrobial surface prevents odor before it even appears.<\/p><p>The pad is made from <strong>durable, chew-resistant material <\/strong>that withstands both puppies and adult dogs – and can be washed over 300 times without losing effectiveness.<br\/><br\/>Thanks to the <strong>non-slip bottom,<\/strong> it stays firmly in place on any type of floor.<\/p><p>The DryPad is also <strong>environmentally frien<\/strong>dly and reusable – a smart choice that saves you both money and <strong>unnecessary waste.<\/strong><br\/><br\/>In short: a safe, sustainable, and effective solution that<strong> both you and your dog will love.<\/strong><\/p>","page":"","margin_top":24,"margin_bottom":0}},"collapsible_tab_xpWhJW":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Payment & Delivery","heading_size":"medium","icon":"","filled_icon":false,"collapse_icon":"carret","display_top_border":true,"open":false,"content":"<p><strong>Payment:<\/strong><br\/><br\/>You can pay securely with Klarna, card, or bank transfer – choose what suits you best.<\/p><p><strong>Delivery time:<\/strong><br\/><br\/>Since our Norwegian warehouse is currently out of stock, your order will be shipped from our international warehouse.<\/p><ul><li><br\/>1–3 days processing time<br\/><\/li><li><br\/>4–9 days delivery time<br\/><\/li><\/ul><p>A tracking number will be sent by email as soon as the package leaves the warehouse.<\/p><p><strong>Any questions?<\/strong><br\/><br\/>Contact us via the contact form – we usually reply within 24 hours on weekdays.<\/p>","page":"","margin_top":24,"margin_bottom":0}}},"block_order":["title","rating_stars_3gpML9","price","text_y9BGLJ","text_RrbPhA","44